# Fail-open on an undecodable value: enforcement judges the stamped body of an
# envelope no reader can be served (or, with no decoder, ignores the envelope
# bytes) and admits it.
MODULE: ValidationBeforeCommitUndecodableAdmitted
TARGET: ValidationBeforeCommit
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: enforcement admits a value whose envelope cannot be decoded
PERTURBS: RunEnforcement

--- FIND
    /\ IF ~policyOn \/ (val.body = "Good" /\ Decodable(val))
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF ~policyOn \/ val.body = "Good"
--- END
